    "updated_at": "2025-03-03T15:50:38Z",
    "body": "Thanks for filing, this is great to track. I will say I do think this can be separated from composed selection range work in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1342 and https://github.com/w3c/selection-api/pull/345. Getting composed selection ranges wired up correctly and working across shadow DOMs seems tangential to this, especially since the issue here does not depend on the infrastructure provided by the composed selection work, and there are significant compat differences between the two efforts.",
