    "updated_at": "2025-03-08T18:42:26Z",
    "body": "> Given this, the Selection API does expect the Range API to return endpoints that are within shadow trees.\n\nYep, I think that's what @annevk is saying is a problem that was never really thought through, and should be fixed. I think I agree, but I just think that it can come after we fully specify `getComposedRanges()`.",
