    "updated_at": "2025-03-13T17:28:23Z",
    "body": "To me, yes, web compat is the main concern. Since this change would be to modify the result of getRangeAt(0) and Range API, I believe this should be separated from the efforts to specify composed range for getComposedRanges().",
